🔴 api in shop is crash looping because external endpoint db.example.com:5432 refuses connections. It fails with "dial tcp db.example.com:5432: connect: connection refused". Every error mentions it. Five failing workloads all depend on it. cart, search, auth and one other are affected as well.
Also grouped: 4 crash loops
To read the output of the last crash, run kubectl logs api-6d4f-0 -c app -n shop --previous

